# Place Your Original Screenshots Here

## Instructions

1. Take screenshots from iPhone simulator or device
2. Drop all screenshot files here
3. Run the resize command to generate App Store-ready images

## Supported Formats

- PNG (recommended)
- JPG/JPEG

## Example Files

```
home-screen.png
prayers-screen.png
study-screen.png
therapy-screen.png
bible-reader.png
settings-screen.png
```

These will be resized to **1242 × 2688px** and saved in the `resized/` folder.
